%% VOTAR-388 — Respaldo diario cifrado de PostgreSQL
%% UAT-01 restore | UAT-03 alerta ENOSPC | UAT-04 ilegible sin clave

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Sched as BackupScheduler<br/>(BACKUP_ENABLED)
  participant Svc as BackupService
  participant PG as PostgreSQL 16
  participant FS as src/backups/
  participant Remote as BACKUP_REMOTE_DIR<br/>(offsite)
  participant Mail as MailService<br/>(ALERT_EMAIL_TO)
  actor Autoridad as Autoridad Electoral

  Note over Sched,Svc: Hora de baja carga (BACKUP_HOUR, default 03:00)

  Sched->>Svc: runBackup()
  Svc->>PG: pg_dump -F c (volcado completo)
  PG-->>Svc: dump temporal (.tmp-*.dump)
  Svc->>Svc: AES-256-GCM (BACKUP_ENCRYPTION_KEY)
  Svc->>FS: escribir *.dump.enc + *.sha256
  Svc->>Svc: assertIntegrity (checksum)
  Svc->>FS: eliminar dump en claro
  alt BACKUP_REMOTE_DIR configurado
    Svc->>Remote: copiar *.dump.enc + *.sha256
  end
  Svc->>FS: podar artefactos > 30 días
  Svc-->>Sched: BackupResult OK

  Note over Svc,Mail: UAT-03 — fallo de disco / integridad
  Svc->>PG: pg_dump
  PG-->>Svc: ENOSPC / error
  Svc->>Mail: sendMail alerta crítica
  Mail-->>Autoridad: [VOTAR] fallo de respaldo PostgreSQL

  Note over FS,Autoridad: UAT-04 — sin clave el archivo es ilegible
  Autoridad->>Remote: lee *.dump.enc sin BACKUP_ENCRYPTION_KEY
  Remote-->>Autoridad: ciphertext AES-GCM (no SQL legible)
